          "asOf": "2026-09-18",
          "id": "bls.cpi.chained.suur0000sa0",
          "indexSeries": "cpi.chained.aug12m",
          "openItems": [
            "M0 GATE: the identity of the series behind index = 'cpi.chained'. 26 USC 1(f)(6)(A) names the index by title only; the mapping to SUUR0000SA0 rests on su.series and the BLS chained-CPI FAQ, not on statute. Cannot be discharged by reading 26 USC 1 or 63.",
            "The 26 USC 1(f)(6)(A) revision-vintage freeze: decide whether the project computes against today's final values and records any residual, or recovers the values as published on 2025-09-11 from the August 2025 release's own tables.",
            "BLS states both 'three subsequent quarterly revisions' (Technical Note) and 'four revisions' (Table 5 footnote 1) in the same release. Unreconciled; it does not affect which months are final at this snapshot, but a reader will trip over it."
          ],
          "seriesId": "SUUR0000SA0",
